WEBVTT

00:09:58.819 --> 00:10:02.568
Knowing this only magnified the effect
that Cape Town had on us.

00:10:04.006 --> 00:10:05.468
Over the course of this week,

00:10:05.492 --> 00:10:08.382
we literally spoke
our life stories to each other,

00:10:08.406 --> 00:10:09.996
from start to finish.

00:10:11.305 --> 00:10:13.805
And this was about analyzing
our own history.

00:10:15.568 --> 00:10:18.401
We followed a strict policy
of being honest,

00:10:18.425 --> 00:10:21.350
and this also came
with a certain exposure,

00:10:21.374 --> 00:10:23.280
an open-chested vulnerability.

00:10:24.312 --> 00:10:26.439
There were gutting confessions,

00:10:26.463 --> 00:10:29.287
and moments where we just
absolutely couldn't fathom

00:10:29.311 --> 00:10:31.119
the other person's experience.